# pylock.android.toml is intentionally TRACKED here — this is an on-device
# gate example, and its lock records the exact wheel hashes that passed the
# contract smoke test on the x86_64 emulator and the Pixel 8a. Regenerating it
# would detach that result from the binaries it was obtained from, and would
# make `kivyforge lock -p android --check` (used by examples/verify-android.ps1)
# unable to fail. See "Example-repo lock policy" in
# docs/design/common/03-lockfile-concept.md.
